@startuml Remove from Cart - Sequence Diagram

actor Customer
participant "CartController" as CartCtrl
participant "CartItem" as CartItem
participant "View" as View

== Remove from Cart ==
Customer -> CartCtrl: remove(item)
CartCtrl -> CartItem: delete()
CartItem --> CartCtrl: deleted
CartCtrl -> View: redirect with success
View --> Customer: show "Item removed from cart"

@enduml
